@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health (checks the RabbitMQ connection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Valid location: 202 Accepted with the eventId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "busId": "bus-99",
  "routeId": "route-01",
  "latitude": 4.8133,
  "longitude": -75.6961,
  "speedKmh": 25,
  "heading": 270,
  "recordedAt": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### Invalid location: 400 with the errors in Spanish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "busId": "",
  "routeId": "route-01",
  "latitude": 120,
  "longitude": -75.6961,
  "speedKmh": 25,
  "heading": 270,
  "recordedAt": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### Routes: id and name of every route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes

### Route details: path and stops, in order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes/route-01

### Unknown route: 404 with the message in Spanish
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes/route-99

### Fleet: every bus and whether it is in use (reported in the last 60 s)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/buses
